Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.91,0:01:36.87,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}把血肉 心靈 盡數吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:40.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:48.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}再等我一下 一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:54.14,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}我如此祈願
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:56.31,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{=18}{\fad(300,300)\be20}只是 只是
